# Line-ending policy.
#
# 2026-09-13: common_config.sh was committed from Windows with CRLF. Every fetch script
# sources it, so bash on the runner read the trailing \r as part of a command
# ("line 6: $'\r': command not found", exit 127) and BOTH the ShineMonitor and DessMonitor
# pipelines failed on every run until it was converted back. Nothing enforced LF, so a
# single editor's default broke all data collection.
#
# Anything executed by bash, or read by a Linux runner, MUST be LF in the repo.

* text=auto

*.sh   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

# Keep binaries untouched.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.bin  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
